Changes:
 tzdata (2026e-0+deb12u1) bookworm-security; urgency=medium
 .
   * Backport 2026d and 2026e:
     - Canada’s Northwest Territories moved to permanent -06 on 2026-08-21 and
       will not fall back from -06 to -07 on 2026-11-01
     - Manitoba moves to permanent -05 on 2026-10-31 and will not fall back
       from -05 to -06 on 2026-11-01
   * Revert POSIX conformance of old SysV names EST5EDT, CST6CDT, MST7MDT and
     PST8PDT (from Aurelien Jarno)
